dsh-win-control README · What it adds：Measured on this machine: `computer_find_text` on a window ≈ **0.2 s**; `computer_find_text`
with `scroll: true` found a marker 180 lines down after **5 scroll steps (~9.5 s, 0 tokens)**;
`computer_act` ≈ **1.3 s via UIA** (probe + Invoke) and ≈ **1.6 s via OCR**;
`computer_window list` ≈ 0.5 s; `computer_open` ≈ 0.6 s. A `computer_look` costs ~10–25 s,
so it is the fallback only.
